#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:11
msgid "8 · Check prior sensitivity"
msgstr "8 · Memeriksa sensitivitas prior"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:13
msgid "Measure how much each posterior depends on its prior."
msgstr "Ukur seberapa besar setiap posterior bergantung pada prior-nya."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:15
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need the model chosen in {doc}`07-check-fit-and-compare`:"
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan model yang dipilih di {doc}`07-check-fit-and-compare`:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:30
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:40
msgid "The check scales the prior and the likelihood by a small power and measures how much each posterior changes. It is the method of R's priorsense package. Without `sensitivity_vars=`, it covers every scalar and group-level parameter."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan ini memangkatkan prior dan likelihood dengan pangkat kecil, lalu mengukur seberapa besar setiap posterior berubah. Ini adalah metode paket priorsense di R. Tanpa `sensitivity_vars=`, pemeriksaan mencakup setiap parameter skalar dan tingkat grup."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:44
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Kolom"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Arti"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "`prior`"
msgstr "`prior`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Sensitivity to scaling the prior"
msgstr "Sensitivitas terhadap penskalaan prior"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "`likelihood`"
msgstr "`likelihood`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Sensitivity to scaling the likelihood"
msgstr "Sensitivitas terhadap penskalaan likelihood"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "`diagnosis`"
msgstr "`diagnosis`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "The verdict for the parameter"
msgstr "Kesimpulan untuk parameter tersebut"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:52
msgid "A value above 0.05 counts as sensitive. The `diagnosis` column flags two cases:"
msgstr "Nilai di atas 0.05 dianggap sensitif. Kolom `diagnosis` menandai dua kasus:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Diagnosis"
msgstr "Diagnosis"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Yang perlu dilakukan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "potential prior-data conflict"
msgstr "potential prior-data conflict"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Prior and likelihood are both sensitive: they disagree"
msgstr "Prior dan likelihood sama-sama sensitif: keduanya tidak sejalan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Revise the prior in {doc}`02-specify-model` and check it again in {doc}`03-check-priors`"
msgstr "Perbaiki prior di {doc}`02-specify-model` dan periksa lagi di {doc}`03-check-priors`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "potential strong prior / weak likelihood"
msgstr "potential strong prior / weak likelihood"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Only the prior is sensitive: the data says little about the parameter"
msgstr "Hanya prior yang sensitif: data hanya sedikit memberi informasi tentang parameter tersebut"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md
msgid "Report the prior with the result, or choose a prior you can justify"
msgstr "Laporkan prior bersama hasilnya, atau pilih prior yang dapat Anda pertanggungjawabkan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid "With no flagged parameter, continue to {doc}`09-estimate-areas`."
msgstr "Jika tidak ada parameter yang ditandai, lanjutkan ke {doc}`09-estimate-areas`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:61
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:63
msgid "**`ValueError`.** `sensitivity_vars=` is given without `run_prior_sensitivity=True`:"
msgstr "**`ValueError`.** `sensitivity_vars=` diberikan tanpa `run_prior_sensitivity=True`:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:72
msgid "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Fit the model first."
msgstr "**`ModelNotFittedError`.** Lakukan fitting model terlebih dahulu."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:74
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/08-prior-sensitivity.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why the prior is checked both before and after fitting: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."
msgstr "Mengapa prior diperiksa sebelum dan sesudah fitting: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."

